# Support & Help Center – UI Implementation Rule

## Objective

Build the Support & Help Center page for the Ashraf Courier Business Platform, providing comprehensive self-service resources, FAQ management, help articles, video tutorials, and multiple contact channels. **No backend logic or API integration—focus is on layout, navigation, and user experience.**

---

## 1. Technology & Design System

- **Framework:** Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS only
- **UI Components:** shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com/)
- **State Management:** Zustand (for client-side state, if needed)
- **Transitions:** Use premium, subtle transitions as per premium-transitions-and-effects.mdc
- **Accessibility:** All UI must be accessible (ARIA, keyboard navigation, color contrast)
- **Video Integration:** HTML5 video with custom controls, YouTube embeds, or Vimeo integration

---

## 2. Scope & Requirements

### Support & Help Center Features (All UI, No Backend)
- **FAQ System:** Categorized frequently asked questions with expandable answers
- **Help Articles:** Comprehensive knowledge base with search and filtering
- **Video Tutorials:** Embedded video content with playlists and progress tracking
- **Contact Support:** Multiple contact methods (email, phone, live chat mock)
- **Search & Navigation:** Global search across all help resources
- **Category Organization:** Logical grouping of help topics by user journey
- **Feedback System:** Rate helpfulness and suggest improvements (mock)
- **Related Articles:** Smart suggestions based on current topic
- **Bookmarking:** Save helpful articles for later reference (mock)
- **Print/Export:** Download help articles as PDF (mock)

---

## 3. Page Structure & Layout

### Header Section
- **Page Title:** "Support & Help Center" with search prominence
- **Global Search:** Full-width search bar with autocomplete suggestions
- **Quick Actions:** Contact Support, Live Chat, Report Issue
- **Breadcrumb Navigation:** Clear path to current location

### Main Content Area
- **Hero Section:** Welcome message, quick search, popular topics
- **Category Grid:** Visual cards for main help categories
- **Featured Content:** Latest articles, trending topics, new features
- **Quick Start Guide:** Step-by-step onboarding for new users

### Sidebar Navigation
- **Help Categories:** Collapsible tree structure
- **Recent Articles:** Last viewed help content
- **Bookmarked Items:** Saved articles and tutorials
- **Support Status:** Current ticket status (mock)

### Footer Section
- **Additional Resources:** External links, community forums
- **Contact Information:** Support hours, response times
- **Feedback Form:** Rate your experience, suggest improvements

