## 7. State Management

### Local State
- **Search Query:** Current search term and results
- **Active Category:** Currently selected help category
- **Expanded FAQs:** Array of expanded FAQ item IDs
- **Bookmarked Items:** Array of bookmarked content IDs
- **Video Progress:** Current video playback position
- **Contact Form:** Form data and submission state

### State Updates
- **Search Results:** Filter content based on search query
- **Category Selection:** Update content display and navigation
- **FAQ Expansion:** Toggle individual FAQ items
- **Bookmark Toggle:** Add/remove items from bookmarks
- **Video Tracking:** Update progress and completion status
- **Form Submission:** Handle contact form submission (mock)

