## 9. Navigation & Routing

### Page Route
- **Path:** `/support`
- **Access:** From dashboard help icon, footer links, or direct URL

### Internal Navigation
- **Category Pages:** `/support/{category}` (e.g., `/support/shipments`)
- **Article Pages:** `/support/article/{id}` (e.g., `/support/article/001`)
- **FAQ Pages:** `/support/faq/{category}` (e.g., `/support/faq/getting-started`)
- **Video Pages:** `/support/video/{id}` (e.g., `/support/video/001`)
- **Contact Page:** `/support/contact`

### External Links
- **Community Forum:** Link to external community platform
- **API Documentation:** Link to developer documentation
- **Status Page:** Link to system status page
- **Social Media:** Link to support social channels

