## 10. Accessibility Requirements

### ARIA Labels
- **Search Input:** `aria-label="Search help center"`
- **FAQ Items:** `aria-label="FAQ: {question}"`
- **Video Players:** `aria-label="Video tutorial: {title}"`
- **Navigation:** `aria-label="Help category navigation"`

### Keyboard Navigation
- **Tab Order:** Logical flow through all interactive elements
- **Arrow Keys:** Navigate between FAQ items and articles
- **Enter/Space:** Expand/collapse FAQs, play videos
- **Escape:** Close modals and return to main content

### Screen Reader Support
- **Live Regions:** Announce search results and content changes
- **Status Updates:** Announce video progress and form submissions
- **Content Structure:** Proper heading hierarchy and landmark regions

### Video Accessibility
- **Captions:** Provide closed captions for all video content
- **Transcripts:** Full text transcripts for video tutorials
- **Audio Descriptions:** Describe visual content for blind users
- **Keyboard Controls:** Full keyboard navigation for video players

---

## 11. Performance & UX Considerations

### Loading States
- **Initial Load:** Skeleton loading for content sections
- **Search Results:** Loading indicator during search
- **Video Loading:** Progressive loading with thumbnail previews
- **Category Navigation:** Smooth transitions between categories

### Content Optimization
- **Lazy Loading:** Load content as needed
- **Image Optimization:** Responsive images with proper sizing
- **Video Optimization:** Adaptive bitrate, multiple quality options
- **Caching Strategy:** Cache frequently accessed content

### Transitions & Animations
- **Content Transitions:** Smooth fade-in for search results
- **FAQ Expansion:** Smooth height animation with easing
- **Category Changes:** Smooth content replacement
- **Loading States:** Subtle loading animations

---

## 12. Error Handling & Edge Cases

### Empty States
- **No Search Results:** Clear message with search suggestions
- **Empty Category:** Friendly message with related categories
- **No Content:** CTA to contact support or browse other categories

### Error States
- **Search Failures:** Retry button with error message
- **Video Loading Errors:** Fallback thumbnail with retry option
- **Form Submission Errors:** Clear error messages with suggestions
- **Network Issues:** Offline indicator with cached content

### Content Fallbacks
- **Missing Images:** Placeholder images with alt text
- **Video Unavailable:** Article version as fallback
- **Broken Links:** 404 handling with search suggestions
- **Content Not Found:** Redirect to relevant category

---

## 13. Testing & Validation

### Functionality Testing
- **Search Accuracy:** Verify search finds relevant content
- **Navigation Flow:** Test all category and content navigation
- **Form Submissions:** Test contact forms and feedback systems
- **Video Playback:** Test video controls and progress tracking

### Accessibility Testing
- **Screen Reader:** Test with NVDA, JAWS, VoiceOver
- **Keyboard Navigation:** Test all interactions without mouse
- **Color Contrast:** Verify WCAG AA compliance
- **Video Accessibility:** Test captions, transcripts, and controls

### Performance Testing
- **Search Performance:** Test search with large content datasets
- **Video Loading:** Test video performance on different connections
- **Mobile Performance:** Test on various mobile devices
- **Memory Usage:** Monitor memory consumption during video playback

